619	    /**
620	     * Split an amount (more than 0.00 and less than the claim's amount) off an OPEN claim. The claim keeps
621	     * the rest and is released from any figure a statement bound it to; a new OPEN claim of the same person
622	     * takes the amount split off, with the same date and note, the next number, opened by the user and
623	     * due by its date plus the terms then of its person's grade on its date, naming the claim it was split
624	     * from, carrying its tags, and a late entry when that claim is. It is judged by the claim split alone: a claim not OPEN, a deferred one, one due by a date inside a closed period, an amount out of range, or a
625	     * split by a role the sheet's permission matrix does not allow to open a claim is refused and nothing
626	     * changes. Returns the person it belongs to.
627	     */
628	    @Transactional
629	    public long split(String sheetId, String user, long claimId, BigDecimal amount) {
