1008	     * period's while period numbering is on), its old number never given again; a draft gets none. It is
1009	     * released from any figure a statement bound it to (live again until its new person's next statement), and lists as its new person's newest claim. A settled or voided claim, a
1010	     * correction, a claim due by a date inside a closed period or after the new person's retirement date, or a move
1011	     * by a role the sheet's permission matrix does not allow (a steward, unless set) is refused and nothing changes. Returns the people it moved from and to.
1012	     */
1013	    @Transactional
1014	    public long[] reassign(String sheetId, String user, long claimId, long toPersonId) {
