118	     * Save the person's name and record the grade from a date (none: the sheet's today), keeping the
119	     * grades already recorded; a grade left as the row showed it (in force on the sheet's today) with no
120	     * date records nothing. The person's own terms and contact are set to those given (null: none); a contact
121	     * another person on the sheet has is refused. The edit names the grade in force on the sheet's today after
122	     * it and, when they changed, the terms and the contact.
123	     */
124	    @Transactional
125	    public Person edit(String sheetId, String user, long personId, Long version, String name, String grade,
